' Viewport: INFO and the statistics (`preset classic|extended ai none seed 3
' start 30 party window 640x480`, as it is and with `newgfx off`): the
' companion camped at Paradise Camp, INFO opened, resized, switched to
' fullscreen and back, and clicked after each change (`sceneclick` is the
' screen's own 320 x 200, made a window pixel when the step is taken); then
' the statistics the same way. v12_viewport_info_still (every resize and
' switch a `resize 640x480`) must give the same game lines and save.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
join                     ' camped here: the place is ours
wait 10
press r                  ' INFO
wait 3
snap info_640
resize 1920x1080         ' 2x: 512 x 240
wait 3
snap info_1920
sceneclick 240,115       ' the production: the first, by choice
wait 3
snap info_1920_chosen
resize 600x449           ' the computed minimum: 320 x 200
wait 3
snap info_600
sceneclick 240,115       ' the next production
wait 3
f11
wait 3
snap info_full
sceneclick 240,115       ' and the next, in fullscreen
wait 3
f11
wait 3
snap info_back
sceneclick 10,180        ' Back: INFO closed
wait 3
snap map_after_info
press h                  ' the statistics
wait 3
snap stats_back
resize 1280x720
wait 3
snap stats_1280
f11
wait 3
snap stats_full
f11
wait 3
resize 600x449
wait 3
snap stats_600
sceneclick 160,100       ' any click closes them
wait 3
snap map_after_stats
resize 640x480
wait 3
save
quit
